{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41190","headline":"登楼望月二首 一 · 刘斌","name":"登楼望月二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圆月当新霁，高楼见最明。\n素波流粉壁，丹桂拂飞甍。\n下瞰千门静，旁观万象生。\n梧桐窗下影，鸟鹊槛前声。\n啸逸刘琨兴，吟资庾亮情。\n游人莫登眺，迢递故乡程。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘斌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}